<title>USA: Simon DeBartolo files $750 mln shelf debt.</title>
<headline>Simon DeBartolo files $750 mln shelf debt.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group L.P. filed Friday with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $750 million in debt securities.</p>
<p>Net proceeds will be used by the firm's operating partnership for general corporate purposes, including repayment of debt, financing of capital commitments and possible future acquisitions, the firm said.</p>
<p>No underwriters were listed in the filing.</p>
</text>
